<title>UK: Prism to submit final tender for rail firms.</title>
<headline>Prism to submit final tender for rail firms.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British passenger railway operating company Prism Rail Plc said on Monday it was one of the parties invited to submit a final tender for the franchise to operate North West Regional Railways Ltd and ScotRail Railways Ltd.</p>
<p>Only 12 of Britain's 25 train operating companies remain in state hands and the government hopes to sell off as many as possible ahead of a general election due by May.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
